<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Briggs &amp; Stratton cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Briggs &amp; Stratton cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer said it downgraded Briggs &amp; Stratton Corp to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Briggs &amp; Stratton lost 1-7/8 to 50-7/8.</p>
</text>
